  Content: "The lower layer of the city of Agartha, built and augmented from the existing
    infrastructure of Agartha. Contains a combination of residential districts interspersed
    with commercial and restaurant sectors. \n\nDue to the crowded conditions, personal
    transportation is scarcely used in Lower Agartha, and most Agarthans rely on the
    dense network of trains centered on Seven Stars Station."
